{
  "kanji": "位",
  "completeCard": "---\nkanji: 位\ntitle: rank; position\njlpt: 3\ntags: [jlpt-n3, grade-4, structure-unclassified]\nstrokes: 7\nradical: 人\nradicalNumber: 9\nonyomi: [イ]\nkunyomi: [くらい, ぐらい]\ndistractors: [立, 住, 体]\n---\n\n# 位 — rank; position\n\n**Strokes:** 7 · **Key (radical):** 人 (as 亻, no. 9) · **JLPT:** N3 (community list)\n\n## Meaning and origin\n\n位 identifies a position in an ordering or hierarchy.\n[地位](../words/地位.md) ちい concerns social standing; 一位 いちい is first place in a ranking.\nPosition here need not be a physical spot on the ground.\n\n**Modern-shape mnemonic:** imagine the person on the left standing at a ranked position beside [立](立.md).\nThe visible combination helps memory; no historical structural classification is asserted.\n\n## Readings\n\n| Reading | Type | Typical words |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| イ | on | [地位](../words/地位.md) ちい — social position; 一位 いちい — first place |\n| くらい | kun | 位 くらい — rank; standing |\n\n## Common words\n\n- [地位](../words/地位.md) ちい — social position; status\n- 一位 いちい — first place\n- 位 くらい — rank; level\n\n## Notes\n\nRadical 人 is visible as 亻. Removing it leaves [立](立.md); [住](住.md) and [体](体.md) have different right sides.\nThere is also an approximate-amount expression くらい, as in 三分くらい (さんぷんくらい), \"about three minutes.\"\nJMdict lists 位 only as a lookup spelling for that expression; use the kana form in this example.\nDo not confuse this with the noun 位 meaning rank.\n",
